      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "Sign in with a Google account that has been granted access.",
          "startMs": 200,
          "endMs": 5136
        },
        {
          "text": "Open Video Studio.",
          "startMs": 5136,
          "endMs": 6641
        },
        {
          "text": "Choose English or Chinese for the interface.",
          "startMs": 6641,
          "endMs": 10322
        },
        {
          "text": "Later, choose the output language in your project settings: the",
          "startMs": 10322,
          "endMs": 15592
        },
        {
          "text": "interface language and the final video's language are separate choices.",
          "startMs": 15592,
          "endMs": 21531
        },
        {
          "text": "Search Douyin for your topic and select one to five useful reference videos.",
          "startMs": 22333,
          "endMs": 29326
        },
        {
          "text": "Look for a strong opening, clear explanation, or effective pacing.",
          "startMs": 29326,
          "endMs": 35399
        },
        {
          "text": "References teach editing techniques; they are not your footage.",
          "startMs": 35399,
          "endMs": 41196
        },
        {
          "text": "If the analyze button asks for a reference,",
          "startMs": 41196,
          "endMs": 45152
        },
        {
          "text": "return to step one and select a result.",
          "startMs": 45152,
          "endMs": 48741
        },
        {
          "text": "Upload the video you want to improve, up",
          "startMs": 49567,
          "endMs": 53204
        },
        {
          "text": "to seven minutes and two hundred fifty megabytes.",
          "startMs": 53204,
          "endMs": 57661
        },
        {
          "text": "Name the project and confirm your rights to edit it.",
          "startMs": 57661,
          "endMs": 62390
        },
        {
          "text": "Wait for upload completion.",
          "startMs": 62390,
          "endMs": 64845
        },
        {
          "text": "Saved progress shows bytes stored on the server.",
          "startMs": 64845,
          "endMs": 69210
        },
        {
          "text": "If interrupted, follow the resume or retry message rather than creating duplicate projects.",
          "startMs": 69210,
          "endMs": 77486
        },
        {
          "text": "In Script and intended message, explain the subject, audience takeaway, and next action.",
          "startMs": 78300,
          "endMs": 85941
        },
        {
          "text": "For example: tour an apartment in Bangkok; show its layout, natural",
          "startMs": 85941,
          "endMs": 91759
        },
        {
          "text": "light, and kitchen; end with an invitation to book a viewing.",
          "startMs": 91759,
          "endMs": 97055
        },
        {
          "text": "Include exact facts and a full script when available.",
          "startMs": 97055,
          "endMs": 101658
        },
        {
          "text": "This field guides the edit; it does not automatically create a new voiceover.",
          "startMs": 101658,
          "endMs": 108343
        },
        {
          "text": "Use Brand rules and claims to avoid for tone and factual limits.",
          "startMs": 109167,
          "endMs": 115336
        },
        {
          "text": "For example: calm and professional; no invented prices or distances; no guaranteed returns.",
          "startMs": 115336,
          "endMs": 124109
        },
        {
          "text": "For citizenship content, avoid promises of approval.",
          "startMs": 124109,
          "endMs": 129121
        },
        {
          "text": "For travel, do not invent visa rules.",
          "startMs": 129121,
          "endMs": 132688
        },
        {
          "text": "State missing facts explicitly.",
          "startMs": 132688,
          "endMs": 135677
        },
        {
          "text": "Never present unrelated B-roll as proof of the featured property or place.",
          "startMs": 135677,
          "endMs": 142810
        },
        {
          "text": "Choose your topic, target audience, tone, and output language.",
          "startMs": 143633,
          "endMs": 149335
        },
        {
          "text": "Set the project AI spending limit.",
          "startMs": 149335,
          "endMs": 152462
        },
        {
          "text": "It is a ceiling, not a fixed price; reference search charges are separate.",
          "startMs": 152462,
          "endMs": 159267
        },
        {
          "text": "Click Analyze and build my plan.",
          "startMs": 159267,
          "endMs": 162210
        },
        {
          "text": "Wait for the reference analysis and your footage analysis.",
          "startMs": 162210,
          "endMs": 167543
        },
        {
          "text": "If analysis fails, your saved video does not need to be uploaded again.",
          "startMs": 167543,
          "endMs": 174073
        },
        {
          "text": "Read the reference DNA to understand the techniques being borrowed.",
          "startMs": 174900,
          "endMs": 180390
        },
        {
          "text": "Then inspect the proposed Director Timeline against your own footage.",
          "startMs": 180390,
          "endMs": 186044
        },
        {
          "text": "Each decision should explain what changes, where, and why.",
          "startMs": 186044,
          "endMs": 190796
        },
        {
          "text": "A reference about another subject must not introduce its facts into your video.",
          "startMs": 190796,
          "endMs": 197270
        },
        {
          "text": "Accept a suitable plan into the editor, then review the individual shots.",
          "startMs": 197270,
          "endMs": 203251
        },
        {
          "text": "Select a shot.",
          "startMs": 204067,
          "endMs": 205319
        },
        {
          "text": "Adjust its source range, framing, camera movement, transition, or text.",
          "startMs": 205319,
          "endMs": 211672
        },
        {
          "text": "Check the timeline layers for graphics, sound effects, and inserts.",
          "startMs": 211672,
          "endMs": 217667
        },
        {
          "text": "Approve the shot when satisfied.",
          "startMs": 217667,
          "endMs": 220530
        },
        {
          "text": "Changing its editing settings clears approval.",
          "startMs": 220530,
          "endMs": 224646
        },
        {
          "text": "Lock a decision you want to preserve.",
          "startMs": 224646,
          "endMs": 227956
        },
        {
          "text": "Save your plan; only approved shots are included in the rendered output.",
          "startMs": 227956,
          "endMs": 234398
        },
        {
          "text": "Upload licensed clips in Video and music",
          "startMs": 235200,
          "endMs": 238914
        },
        {
          "text": "library, or use the scene's stock search.",
          "startMs": 238914,
          "endMs": 242721
        },
        {
          "text": "Import a useful result, then match it to the selected shot.",
          "startMs": 242721,
          "endMs": 248199
        },
        {
          "text": "AI reviews sampled portions, not every frame of long assets.",
          "startMs": 248199,
          "endMs": 253770
        },
        {
          "text": "Preview the proposed insert, replace the decision, and approve it again.",
          "startMs": 253770,
          "endMs": 260455
        },
        {
          "text": "Generated B-roll is an illustration, not verified news or property evidence.",
          "startMs": 260455,
          "endMs": 267511
        },
        {
          "text": "Correct caption text and choose its style.",
          "startMs": 268333,
          "endMs": 272100
        },
        {
          "text": "Use visual cards only with supplied facts and accurate values.",
          "startMs": 272100,
          "endMs": 277661
        },
        {
          "text": "Upload licensed music, select a track, and adjust volume, fades, or ducking.",
          "startMs": 277661,
          "endMs": 284477
        },
        {
          "text": "You can request a music suggestion or",
          "startMs": 284477,
          "endMs": 287795
        },
        {
          "text": "preview safe cuts aligned to detected accents.",
          "startMs": 287795,
          "endMs": 291921
        },
        {
          "text": "These are estimates: listen to the rendered mix before approving the result.",
          "startMs": 291921,
          "endMs": 298737
        },
        {
          "text": "Save your changes before asking AI for an alternative.",
          "startMs": 299567,
          "endMs": 304256
        },
        {
          "text": "Select an unlocked shot, choose the task, and describe a specific improvement.",
          "startMs": 304256,
          "endMs": 311030
        },
        {
          "text": "For example: use a gentle push-in while keeping the speaker's full sentence.",
          "startMs": 311030,
          "endMs": 317630
        },
        {
          "text": "Review the proposal before replacing it.",
          "startMs": 317630,
          "endMs": 321104
        },
        {
          "text": "No suitable match means the edit stays unchanged.",
          "startMs": 321104,
          "endMs": 325359
        },
        {
          "text": "Reapprove changed shots and save again.",
          "startMs": 325359,
          "endMs": 328746
        },
        {
          "text": "Render the approved plan.",
          "startMs": 329567,
          "endMs": 331959
        },
        {
          "text": "Watch the complete master with sound: check",
          "startMs": 331959,
          "endMs": 336074
        },
        {
          "text": "cuts, words, subtitles, overlays, and factual claims.",
          "startMs": 336074,
          "endMs": 341147
        },
        {
          "text": "Optional AI review scores five editorial categories and may draft corrections.",
          "startMs": 341147,
          "endMs": 348612
        },
        {
          "text": "A proposed fix is not a verified improvement.",
          "startMs": 348612,
          "endMs": 352918
        },
        {
          "text": "Read any reasons a correction could not be made.",
          "startMs": 352918,
          "endMs": 357512
        },
        {
          "text": "After changing the plan, render again; an existing video does not update automatically.",
          "startMs": 357512,
          "endMs": 365838
        },
        {
          "text": "After reviewing the master, prepare the platform package.",
          "startMs": 366667,
          "endMs": 371446
        },
        {
          "text": "Check the duration, aspect ratio, opening, captions, cover,",
          "startMs": 371446,
          "endMs": 376393
        },
        {
          "text": "and call to action for each version.",
          "startMs": 376393,
          "endMs": 379411
        },
        {
          "text": "Review and lock the versions you accept.",
          "startMs": 379411,
          "endMs": 382765
        },
        {
          "text": "Download the video and export files.",
          "startMs": 382765,
          "endMs": 385784
        },
        {
          "text": "Lumen does not publish to your social accounts automatically.",
          "startMs": 385784,
          "endMs": 390898
        },
        {
          "text": "You make the final editorial and publishing decision.",
          "startMs": 390898,
          "endMs": 395342
        }
      ]
    }
  },
